								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13504#msg13504">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #60 on:</b> January 03, 2005, 12:41:44 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							when kunark was released, vp was not finished<br />there were also numerous bugs regarding drop tables and unanticipated player discovered things that led to nerfs (RFS, moss covered twig etc)<br /><br />when velious was released, TOV was not ready and it had to be tuned down to even be doable<br /><br />in some ways verant was just as bad as SoE
						</td>
					</tr>
