							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13508#msg13508"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13508#msg13508">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #62 on:</b> January 03, 2005, 11:17:05 am &#187;</span></td>
