								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Well said Kin <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> Thats why I think that people are gonna be playing wow for a while, because you can solo pretty much everything. Pretty much the only things you can&#039;t do solo are the raid encounters and elite instances. 
