								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=695"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13513#msg13513"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13513#msg13513">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #63 on:</b> January 03, 2005, 05:27:14 pm &#187;</span></td>
